---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/site';
---

<!-- Text of the "Privacy Policy" panel on the Webflow About page, with its lists restored. -->
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Plinth Analytics collects, uses, and shares personal data.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <p>
        Plinth Analytics (hereinafter "we" or "us") is committed to protecting the personal data of our customers,
        partners, and users who interact with our online services, including Google Ads. This privacy policy outlines
        how we collect, use, and share your personal data. We collect the following types of personal data:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>When provided: account information such as name, email, Job Title, Company.</li>
        <li>User behavior: clicks, conversions, and impressions from users who interact with our ads.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We use this data to provide you with targeted advertising, track the effectiveness of our campaigns, and improve
        your user experience.
      </p>
      <p>We may use your personal data for various purposes, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Delivering targeted ads based on your interests and behavior.</li>
        <li>Analyzing the effectiveness of our ad campaigns.</li>
        <li>Improving user experience by optimizing ad placement and content.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will only share your personal data with law enforcement agencies if requested (as required by law).</p>
      <p>We take the security of your personal data seriously. We implement various security measures, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Secure servers and networks.</li>
        <li>Regular software updates and patches.</li>
        <li>Employee training on data protection best practices.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>As a data subject, you have certain rights under applicable laws, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The right to access your personal data.</li>
        <li>The right to correct or update your personal data.</li>
        <li>The right to object to the processing of your personal data.</li>
        <li>The right to erase (delete) your personal data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this privacy policy or concerns regarding our handling of personal data, please
        contact us: Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        This privacy policy is effective as of July 27, 2024. We may update this policy from time to time. If we make
        any material changes to the policy, we will notify you through our website or by other means. By using Google
        Ads, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to the terms of this privacy policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
